# ai-trace-remover

cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "ai-trace-remover: de-AI-flavour detection and rewriting for Chinese and English prose"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
date-created: 2026-10-19
authors:
  - family-names: "Shi"
    given-names: "Jiaming"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JiamingShi-JsPhys/ai-trace-remover"
description: "A universal skill that removes AI traces from Chinese and English prose. A pure standard-library scanner reports AI-pattern hits, a 0-100 human index, blocking hard-bans, and the five 'sound of a person' checks. The engine detects and quantifies; the agent rewrites by hand. Pattern categories are original; before/after examples are self-authored and built from public-domain teaching texts and classic public-domain fiction."
keywords:
  - de-ai
  - humanizer
  - ai-flavour
  - chinese-w